      "props": {
        "code": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 480 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Left: a stylized biological neuron with dendrites feeding a soma and an axon leaving it. An approximately-equals sign in the middle. Right: an artificial neuron with input dots feeding a summation node with a bias, then an activation function f, then an output y.\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;color:currentColor;font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;\">\n  <g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n    <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"95\" r=\"26\"/>\n    <line x1=\"126\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"212\" y2=\"95\"/>\n    <line x1=\"212\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"80\"/><line x1=\"212\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"234\" y2=\"95\"/><line x1=\"212\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"110\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" opacity=\"0.7\">\n    <line x1=\"22\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"82\"/><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"74\" y2=\"93\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"108\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"72\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"11\" opacity=\"0.7\">\n    <text x=\"16\" y=\"34\">dendrites</text>\n    <text x=\"168\" y=\"88\">axon</text>\n  </g>\n  <g fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"11\">\n    <text x=\"100\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\" opacity=\"0.7\">soma</text>\n    <text x=\"115\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\">biological neuron</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"258\" y=\"102\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"26\" opacity=\"0.6\">≈</text>\n  <g fill=\"currentColor\">\n    <circle cx=\"302\" cy=\"62\" r=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"302\" cy=\"95\" r=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"302\" cy=\"128\" r=\"4\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.55\">\n    <line x1=\"306\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"354\" y2=\"88\"/><line x1=\"306\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"352\" y2=\"95\"/><line x1=\"306\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"354\" y2=\"102\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n    <circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"95\" r=\"20\"/>\n    <rect x=\"412\" y=\"78\" width=\"34\" height=\"34\" rx=\"5\"/>\n    <line x1=\"394\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"95\"/>\n    <line x1=\"446\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"95\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"374\" y=\"101\" font-size=\"18\">Σ</text>\n    <text x=\"374\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"11\" opacity=\"0.8\">＋ b</text>\n    <text x=\"429\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"16\">f</text>\n    <text x=\"468\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\">y</text>\n    <text x=\"378\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"13\">artificial neuron</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>",
        "caption": "The artificial neuron mirrors the biological one, part for part: dendrites → inputs, synapse strengths → weights, the cell body's summation → Σ + bias, and 'firing' → the activation function f.\""
